{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "boutique-golden-signals",
  "title": "Boutique \u2014 Golden Signals",
  "description": "Latency, traffic, errors, saturation for Online Boutique (Managed Prometheus). Aligns with Phase 9-A SRE dashboards.",
  "tags": [
    "boutique",
    "sre",
    "golden-signals"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "type": "constant",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "query": "boutique",
        "current": {
          "text": "boutique",
          "value": "boutique"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Browse latency runbook",
      "url": "https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/browse-latency-burn.md",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "doc"
    },
    {
      "title": "Checkout latency runbook",
      "url": "https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/runbooks/checkout-latency-burn.md",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "doc"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Golden signals** for `boutique` namespace (GMP datasource `gmp`).\nTune PromQL after rebuild if metric names differ (kube-state-metrics / cAdvisor).\nOfficial SLOs live in **Cloud Monitoring** \u2014 see [SLO overview](/d/boutique-slo-overview) and [catalog](https://github.com/btilki/boutique-gke-sre/blob/main/docs/sre/slos/catalog.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Traffic \u2014 container CPU cores (proxy for load)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gmp"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "cores"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "gmp"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors \u2014 container restarts",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gmp"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"$namespace\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "gmp"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturation \u2014 memory working set",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gmp"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "gmp"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturation \u2014 CPU throttling rate",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "gmp"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "gmp"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Latency note",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Request latency** for browse/checkout SLOs is owned by **Cloud Monitoring** (LB `total_latencies` + checkout distribution), not GMP.\nUse Cloud Console SLO charts or the **Boutique \u2014 SLO Overview** dashboard links. Trace slow checkout in **Cloud Trace** (`checkoutservice` / PlaceOrder)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
